s do as much as you can to cause  chaos in the outpost and try to isolate  the captain from his followers you can  it'll make your life a whole lot easier  than just getting completely overwhelmed  by his lackeys the enemy AI is actually  pretty forgiving if you need to run away  and recoup for a little bit orcs have a  relatively short attention span to climb  somewhere high where they can't see you  wait for them to stop looking for you  and dive right back in the captains and  WarChiefs don't really tend to leave  their area so you can whittle their  health down bit by bit if you really  need  so there we are some quick and easy tips  to get you started in shadow of war for  more on the game including late-game  tips and a guide to get the most out of  the Nemesis system make sure to keep  your eyes peeled to GameSpot  [Music]
 

